Two unrelated things live here.

scan-metadata.py and backfill.py are the operator tools that put videos on
the ingest queue, sharing fk_queue/. They talk to django-api and nothing
else; the README at the repository root describes them.

Everything else is code generation, run by hand and committed:
generate-client.sh and update-schema.sh for the django-api client, and
generate-hook-types.sh, which is just a lil' hack that takes the hook
request/response types from the tusd source, generates a JSON Schema from
them, and turns that into a Pydantic file.
